        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "loc_imperial_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dong Fang Chang Fan adds that although Liu Yi Feng was glaringly talented, he failed when charging toward Gu Immortal realm, and that among that generation the one who remained standing was Hei Bai, commonly known as Hei tribe rockman.",
